  "message": "Our finance team has four mappers and three analysts plus a status check:\n\n- mapper_cash – finds vendor patterns for cash purchases  \n- mapper_card – tracks card‑swipe vendor patterns  \n- mapper_bank – analyzes ACH and online‑transfer patterns, usually recurring bills  \n- mapper_other – handles paper checks and anything uncategorized  \n\n- synthesizer – merges the four mapper reports and flags missed bills, amount anomalies, and new recurring candidates  \n- receipt_scanner – hunts for orphaned or mis‑labelled receipt images and cross‑checks them against the expenses database  \n- expense_reconciler – finds expense rows without matching receipts, excluding known receipt‑less transactions  \n\n- progress_check – gives a read‑only snapshot of what reports already exist and how fresh they are.",
